        222.2747039794922,
        504.6511535644531,
        260.99261474609375
      ],
      "text": "Hi, this is Michelin Meyer. I'm renting your house on Archwood Avenue. I'm\ndue to move in next week.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        273.9320373535156,
        105.86299896240234,
        293.4334411621094
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        293.9146728515625,
        357.50396728515625,
        312.7135925292969
      ],
      "text": "Oh, yes. Hello, Ms. Meyer. What can I do for you?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        325.65203857421875,
        128.062255859375,
        345.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        345.6346740722656,
        520.64306640625,
        404.27362060546875
      ],
      "text": "When I viewed the house, I told you I’ll most probably need to rent some\nfurniture, at least until I know whether my temporary work contract is going to\nbe made permanent.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        417.092041015625,
        105.86299896240234,
        436.59344482421875
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        437.0746765136719,
        522.97119140625,
        475.7926025390625
      ],
      "text": "Yes, of course. I remember. And I said I could give you some information about\nfurniture rental companies in the city.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        488.7320251464844,
        128.062255859375,
        508.2334289550781
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        508.7146911621094,
        142.7392578125,
        527.5136108398438
      ],
      "text": "That's right.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        540.4520263671875,
        105.86299896240234,
        559.9534301757812
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        560.4346923828125,
        512.0030517578125,
        599.152587890625
      ],
      "text": "Well, the biggest company is called Peak Rentals. I've recommended them to\nother people and have always heard positive reports about them.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        612.092041015625,
        128.062255859375,
        631.5934448242188
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        632.07470703125,
        308.06396484375,
        650.8735961914062
      ],
      "text": "Could you give me an idea of their costs?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        663.6920166015625,
        105.86299896240234,
        683.1934204101562
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        683.793701171875,
        517.6483764648438,
        742.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "Sure. I actually have one of their brochures here. It says the monthly price per\nroom starts at $105 and goes up to $239. That depends on which rooms you\nneed furniture for, of course.\n"
    }
